of the relationship

cue0035018
01:00:05.000 --> 01:00:06.000
between Abraham of Burgos

cue0035019
01:00:07.000 --> 01:00:08.000
and Nachmanides.

cue0035020
01:00:09.000 --> 01:00:10.000
There's a legend,

cue0035021
01:00:12.000 --> 01:00:13.000
it's a legend,

cue0035022
