which is later,

cue0035023
01:00:15.000 --> 01:00:16.000
that one of Nachmanides'

cue0035024
01:00:17.000 --> 01:00:18.000
students were called

cue0035025
01:00:19.000 --> 01:00:20.000
by the name Abner.

cue0035026
01:00:21.000 --> 01:00:22.000
We don't have any evidence for it.

cue0035027
01:00:23.000 --> 01:00:24.000
So that I would like to return

cue0035028
01:00:25.000 --> 01:00:26.000
to the answer.

cue0035029
01:00:27.000 --> 01:00:28.000
He was living in Burgos,

cue0035030
