again with Nachmanides,

cue0035036
01:00:41.000 --> 01:00:42.000
despite the fact that

cue0035037
01:00:43.000 --> 01:00:44.000
we have a later legend

cue0035038
01:00:46.000 --> 01:00:47.000
Just to conclude,

cue0035039
01:00:48.000 --> 01:00:49.000
at the beginning

